      "message": "jniCreateFileDescriptor() has error-prone semantics.\n\nI suggest changing the interface to transfer ownership of the fd with unique_fd. There are only 19 call sites to update, and this change will ensure that the bug will never be introduced again.\n\nAs a lazy alternative, we could add an overload with move semantics which wraps the original unsafe function, then mark it [[deprecated]].",
